  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voter Registration Sensitization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voter registrations is key, in fact it is the first and most important step to a successful election but most times it is the most overlooked in our elections. Successive governments haven&#x2019;t exhibited the considerable desired awareness in enlightening voters on how and why to register and this is the same for election. Also, not voluminous NGOs invest their time and resources in complementing government to significantly improve on voter registration and election education therefore, we at Future View applauds CAFOD&#x2019;s effort in investing on these key areas in our prevailing democracy.
Underneath is a list of ideas we want our sensitization to glance at.
MUSIC 
JINGLES
DRAMA
SHORT VIDEOS
FLYERS, BANNERS AND POSTAL
RADIO TALK SHOWS</narrative>
  </description>
